## Usage
```csharp
var builder = new CyrenaBuilder(services);
builder.AddExtensa(o =>
{
    o.ExtensionsDirectory = Path.Combine(appData, "extensions");
    o.InstallationsDirectory = Path.Combine(appData, "installations");
    o.ExtensionInfoFileName = "extension.json";
});
builder.AddExtension<MyEmbeddedExtension>("my-ext", "My Extension", new Version(1, 0, 0));
```
